      "content": "but how do i even \"let go\" when there's nothing left? everything i was is tied to that business. without it, i'm just... a total waste. i've put everything i had into this, and now i'm just staring at zero. it feels like the only logical conclusion to this much failure is to just stop. like, why keep playing when the game is already over?",
